From: XR1710G Hotfix <xr1710g@local>
Date: Mon, 6 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fw4: include br-lan itself when resolving flowtable devices

resolve_lower_devices() previously resolved bridge members but omitted the
bridge device itself. Include br-lan so software flow offload covers
traffic that is bridged locally. Applies on top of 9990 bonding fix.
---
--- a/root/usr/share/ucode/fw4.uc
+++ b/root/usr/share/ucode/fw4.uc
@@ -439,6 +439,9 @@
 				if (index(e, "lower_") === 0)
 					push(devs, ...resolve_lower_devices(devstatus, substr(e, 6)));
 
+			if (devstatus[devname]?.devtype == 'bridge')
+				push(devs, devname);
+
 			break;
 
 		case 'bonding':
